+---
+id: task-001-give-tasks-unique-identifiers
+type: task
+title: "Give tasks unique identifiers"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+workflow: sw-life-cycle (sw-life-cycle-1-plan)
+---
+
+Give each task a stable unique string identifier exposed as `Task.id`. Add `get(id)` to retrieve a
+task by identifier, and allow `find`, `complete`, `reopen`, `rename`, `tag`, `untag`, and `remove`
+to target a task by identifier as well as by title. Preserve identifiers across task updates and
+renames.
